    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠϊών</span></b> , Trag. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾐών</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			994
		</span></i>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊών</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>I.</u>
			1.33
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ag.</u>
			1158
		</span></i> (lyr.), <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀών</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Mosch.
			3.37
		</span></i> (cj.): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ἡ</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shore, beach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅθι κύματ᾽ ἐπ᾽ ἠϊόνος κλύζεσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δέ τ᾽ ἄκραι ἠϊόνες βοόωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.265
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂμ πέτρησι καὶ ἠϊόνεσσι
				καθίζων</span> (
				Ep.
			 dat.) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.156
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				827
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotion
				p.191
			</span></i> W., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				59.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, in pl., of other <i>banks</i>, as of a lake, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				1.33
			</span></i>; of a river, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
			</span></i>l.c., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.659
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., of
			the <i>lower part of the face</i>, over which the tears flow, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>(pl.): sg., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσα ἡ τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν
					περιγραφή</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.71
			</span></i>.</div>
